WEBVTT

00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:02.574
what conflict can offer in our workplaces.

00:02:03.102 --> 00:02:05.887
The power imbalance
in our workplace is real,

00:02:05.911 --> 00:02:07.888
and it's constantly changing.

00:02:07.912 --> 00:02:12.358
Power moves between us,
depending on our roles and status.

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:15.786
Now, sometimes this can feel
like office politics, right?

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.570
Which is never fun.

00:02:17.594 --> 00:02:20.089
But when we contest
for power thoughtfully

00:02:20.113 --> 00:02:22.081
and together with our coworkers,

00:02:22.105 --> 00:02:24.403
it can be incredibly productive.

00:02:24.427 --> 00:02:26.455
And it's that kind of productive conflict

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.534
that I want to talk
to you all about today,

00:02:28.558 --> 00:02:31.166
the kind that can make
some of us uncomfortable.